COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.day_from IS 'First day of the 30-day window (day_to - 29).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.day_to IS 'Last day of family_daily: the window ends there.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.creatives IS 'Creatives (tracker families) with scaling spend in the window.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.spend IS 'Scaling spend in the window, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.purchases IS 'Purchases in Scaling campaigns in the window (the basis''s meaning: Meta purchases, Upstack new customers, or Upstack orders).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.creative_scaling_benchmarks.revenue IS 'Purchase value in the window, dollars (the basis''s meaning).';
COMMENT ON VIEW analytics.creative_content IS 'The copy and transcript Meta actually runs for each creative family (no image or video bytes). Grain: one row per family_key. Source: public.family_content (etl.assets_pull / run_daily). Refresh: nightly. Coverage: creative families with a pulled ad. Caveats: transcript is the spoken audio for videos and can differ from the tracker''s own transcript column.';
